  description: Fast, fragile, and utterly without fear. A needle of pale spite, thrown
    by nobody, at you.
  tactics: Very fast, no gun - its body is the weapon. It crosses the screen in a
    couple of seconds, so treat every Darter lane as briefly poisoned. One hit kills
    it; snap shots work, but simply not being in its column is cheaper.
